<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="el">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ site_name }}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 40rem; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #222; }
    h1   { color: #009639; }
    code { background: #f2f2f2; padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem; border-radius: 3px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Hello from Ansible!</h1>
  <p>Αυτή η σελίδα εγκαταστάθηκε με Ansible και σερβίρεται από nginx.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Host (inventory): <code>{{ inventory_hostname }}</code></li>
    <li>Hostname: <code>{{ ansible_facts['hostname'] }}</code></li>
    <li>OS: <code>{{ ansible_facts['distribution'] }} {{ ansible_facts['distribution_version'] }}</code></li>
    <li>Site root: <code>{{ site_root }}</code></li>
  </ul>
</body>
</html>
